Dear FOI Officer,

This is a request under the Freedom of Information Act 2000 for the location of any records held by The National Archives relating to Great House Farm / Tŷ Mawr, in the parish of Llandough (Llandough-juxta-Penarth), Glamorgan. The relevant Ordnance Survey County Series sheet is Glamorgan XLVII.6, as identified by Glamorgan Archives in its reply 2026/4097b of 30 September 2026. The request includes any Valuation Office survey field books (IR 58) and plans covering that sheet for that parish, and any related closed records.

For each item, please provide, before any consideration of viewing or copying:
- the series, piece, accession, box, shelf or Discovery reference;
- whether the item is open or closed;
- if it is recorded as closed, transferred or held off-site, where it is now held;
- whether staff have physically checked that the item is present in the store (the role of the person who checked, and the date of the check);
- the systems searched, and whether a physical item was retrieved.

This is a location enquiry only. No viewing or copying is requested until the above is confirmed.

Please acknowledge and respond within the statutory 20 working days.

Yours faithfully,

Requester
